Extended Usage:
    Arguments:
      * expr1, expr2, expr3, ... - the arguments must be same type.

    Examples:
      > SELECT 1 in(1, 2, 3);
       true
      > SELECT 1 in(2, 3, 4);
       false
      > SELECT named_struct('a', 1, 'b', 2) in(named_struct('a', 1, 'b', 1), named_struct('a', 1, 'b', 3));
       false
      > SELECT named_struct('a', 1, 'b', 2) in(named_struct('a', 1, 'b', 2), named_struct('a', 1, 'b', 3));
       true

    Since: 1.0.0

Extended Usage:
    Arguments:
